		(descr "MIRRORED 2x08 2.54mm THT header/socket - pad grid mirrored about the local Y axis so that when placed on B.Cu it cancels KiCad's flip and pin N lands on pin N of a normal PinHeader_2x08 sitting topside on the board below. Use for the CONTROL-to-MAIN stack (ctrl J1 mates main J10). Do NOT use on F.Cu.")
